  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the turbulent flow sea area, Ren Xiu Ping’s grandson states that he can use Ren Xiu Ping’s traveling son Gu to return to doting mother Gu, which stays with Ren Xiu Ping. After that use, the grandson arrives inside Ren Xiu Ping’s blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          1156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ren_xiu_ping",
          "gu_traveling_son_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Traveling son Gu and doting mother Gu are named a set of famous Immortal Gu in emotion path. Emotion path is described as originating from wisdom path, whose three elements are thoughts, wills, and emotions.",
        "chapters": [
          1156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pair-and-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "path_emotion",
          "path_wisdom"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The grandson activates traveling son Gu when the hidden room oyster space is collapsing, and the Gu’s power sends him away. He reaches Ren Xiu Ping’s blessed land a few minutes later. At that time the sea area’s chaotic dao marks keep Gu Immortals from using space path Immortal Gu easily, so traveling normally is the safest way, while emotion path use is without danger because emotion path had not been created when that sea area formed.",
        "chapters": [
          1156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "return-to-the-mother-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Shen Shang groups traveling son Gu and doting mother Gu as examples of human emotion and virtue Gu among human path Gu worms. The same stretch states they were once regarded as emotion path Gu worms, but in essence were actually human path.",
        "chapters": [
          2111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path-reading",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shen_shang",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
